          "jcr:created": "Thu Jan 18 2024 17:29:28 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Experience the SmartHospital Platform<br>\n</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The operating system for modern healthcare.</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Transform your healthcare environment into a connected digital ecosystem with the SmartHospital Platform from Stryker. By unifying devices, data and people into one intelligent, adaptive system, the platform helps drive digital transformation at scale across the continuum of care.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Innovation starts here. Explore how we’re enhancing care delivery together.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Mon May 04 2026 16:16:54 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
          "textIsRich": "true"
        }
      }
    },
